%% Layout intelligence — paste into https://mermaid.live
flowchart TB
  DOC[Document + page sample strategy]
  FP[Page fingerprints]
  REG{Known layout in registry?}

  DOC --> FP --> REG

  REG -->|yes| CTR[Pinned extraction contract]
  REG -->|no| SMP[Stratified pages: head, mid, tail, not only first 20]
  SMP --> AI[Multimodal model / Textract Analyze]
  AI --> DRAFT[Draft extraction contract JSON]
  DRAFT --> HUM{Human or policy gate}
  HUM -->|reject| Q[Quarantine + ticket]
  HUM -->|approve| PUB[Publish contract version]
  PUB --> CTR
  CTR --> RUN[Trusted extractor image in ECR]
